cannot diverge in finite time:
\[
\lim_{t \to T^-} \|\Psi(t)\|_{L^2} < \infty
\quad \forall T < \infty.
\]
This non-divergence guarantee is part of the Blackwell Global Stability
Protocol.
\end{theorem}

